SUMMARY:Deadline: Fondation Francois Schneider: Contemporary Talents Compet
 ition - The Earth
DESCRIPTION:The Fondation Francois Schneider's Contemporary Talents competi
 tion\, themed The Earth for this edition\, awards EUR 15\,000 per laureate
  (including acquisition of the work\; EUR 8\,000 for editioned works) plus
  an exhibition at the foundation's centre in Wattwiller. ELIGIBILITY: prof
 essional artists internationally\, in SCULPTURE AND INSTALLATION only (vid
 eo or digital work alone does not qualify). NOTE: the 23 August 2026 deadl
 ine is from a listing site\; the organizer page only states the call runs 
 June to August\, so verify the exact date before applying.\n\nOrganisation
 : Fondation Francois Schneider\nLocation: Wattwiller\, France. Open intern
 ationally to professional artists\; sculpture and installation only.\nAwar
 d: EUR 15\,000 per laureate (includes acquisition\; EUR 8\,000 for edition
 ed works)\, plus exhibition at the foundation. No entry fee.\nDuration: Ca
 ll runs June to August 2026\; laureates exhibited at the foundation in Wat
 twiller.\n\nMore: https://www.fondationfrancoisschneider.org/en/contempora
 ry-talents-competition/contemporary-talents-competition-the-earth/?utm_sou
 rce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
